          "text": "**Fact check:**\n\nX open-sourced its full recommendation algorithm (including organic + ads) on GitHub — first in 2023, with a major 2026 update and recurring releases. Most others (YouTube, Instagram, TikTok, Facebook, Reddit, Threads) keep theirs closed.\n\nBluesky runs on the open AT Protocol for federation and custom algorithms — a different kind of openness focused on decentralization vs. X's transparent code.\n\nBoth are more open than the rest, just in distinct ways. No single platform wins \"truly open\" on every metric."
